Z||000011||fropuff||12-23-2001||06:59 PM||||Sounds like a good idea.  It's a good idea to get the plugs and wires changed anyway.  Maybe the fuel filter as well.  If you're looking for somewhere on TCC repair, it's at: <A HREF="http://home.t-online.de/home/O_Scholz/tcc.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.t-online.de/home/O_Scholz/tcc.html</A> <P>Good luck!||||reg||1
